</li></ul><h2 id="section-2">Sample Ballots</h2><p>Listed by precinct and with style (split), if applicable. Ranked Choice Voting (RCV) ballot listed below each precinct or split ballot. <a href="https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/9be34438fc404b2494a48f7a668914f2"><strong>Visit the online precinct map</strong></a> to find your local precinct with district information, using the address search button on the <a href="https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/9be34438fc404b2494a48f7a668914f2">map</a>. You can also visit <a href="https://secure.sos.state.or.us/orestar/vr/showVoterSearch.do?lang=eng&amp;source=SOS">My Vote</a> to see your ballot under Mark My Ballot.</p><h3>2801</h3><div class="h-100 mb-3">
  
      
